@startuml
title Green Rides - UML State Machine Diagram

[*] --> Login
Login : entry / user logs in
Login : do / verify data
Login : exit / successful login --> JourneyDetails
LoginError : entry / incorrect data
LoginError : do / display error message
LoginError : exit / prevent further interaction

state JourneyDetails
JourneyDetails : entry / user selects destination
JourneyDetails : do / display journey details
JourneyDetails : exit / proceed to next state --> DrivingModeChoice

state DrivingModeChoice
DrivingModeChoice : entry / view driving mode options
DrivingModeChoice : do / allow user to activate driving mode or choose other options
DrivingModeChoice : exit / proceed to next state

state EatSelection
EatSelection : entry / user is hungry
EatSelection : do / allow user to select a place to eat
EatSelection : exit / proceed to next state --> MenuView

state MenuView
MenuView : entry / view menu of selected place
MenuView : do / allow user to place order if interested
MenuView : exit / proceed to next state

state AccidentReporting
AccidentReporting : entry / accident occurs
AccidentReporting : do / inform relevant authorities
AccidentReporting : exit / send notifications during driving or in case of an accident --> [*]

state Feedback
Feedback : entry / user completes journey
Feedback : do / allow users to provide feedback
Feedback : exit / end interaction --> [*]
@enduml
